  "mathematical_review": "Boss2 wave16 integrates three pushed UM primary batches eb09/f3/f4: three linked cores, seven current input contracts, one new numerical-existence contribution and two unchanged canonical relations (one conditional contribution and one whole transfer). The Cheng–Mao allocation pays every positive-delta4+delta numerical threshold, with no transfer of its polynomial clock. Connected-column BORDER is only a narrower route to sparse flat extension; the general extension theorem remains already proved and its positive representation consequence was integrated in wave15. Actual k2 Asahiro gadgets have maximum degree3, yielding a diamondless line graph and the full strict3/2 hardness transfer. All current task/receipt/input/asset pins and three native edge checks were verified. Detailed independent mathematical reconstruction and honest reading scope are in research/workspaces/map-v2/Boss2/recovery-20261112-e8cf4c/wave16-um-root-review.json. Concurrent CAG source changes and four removed stale relations remain pending; this review does not silently adopt or complete their repairs.",
